Hello <%= @order.customer.name %>,

Thank you for your order <%= @order.reference %>. We'll get it ready for you to collect at <%= @order.branch.name %><%= ", #{@order.branch.address}" if @order.branch.address.present? %>, and let you know when it's ready.

<% @order.lines.includes(:product).each do |line| %>
<%= quantity(line.quantity, line.unit) %> x <%= line.description %>  <%= money(line.total_cents) %>
<% end %>
Total <%= money(@order.total_cents) %>

Follow your order: <%= @order.tracking_url %>
Pay when you collect, or ahead by M-Pesa as shown on your order's page. Please bring the order number.
